      "biography": {
        "value": "<h2>Description</h2><p>A mushroom with a fanged mouth and a varying number of eyes. Funguars often use pollen to do things like putting the party to sleep.</p><h2>Defense</h2><p>AC 15, touch 13, flat-footed 13 (+2 dex, +2 natural, +1 size)</p><p>HP 22 [33] (3d8+9)</p><p>Fort +6, Reflex +3, Will +3</p><p>Immune plant traits</p><p>Resist Earth 5, Ice 5, Lightning 10</p><p>Weakness Fire</p><h2>Offense</h2><p>Speed 20 ft.</p><p>Melee Bite +6 (1d6 plus poison), 2 Slams +1 (1d3 plus poison)</p><p>Special Attacks Dream Pollen</p><h2>Statistics</h2><p>Str 10, Dex 15, Con 16, Int 7, Wis 14, Cha 15</p><p>Base Atk +2; CMB +1; CMD 13</p><p>Feats Blind-Fight, Weapon Finesse</p><p>Skills Stealth +11 (+15 in swamps and underground), Survival +3 (+7 in swamps and underground); Racial Modifiers +4 Stealth and Survival in swamps and underground</p>"
      }
